      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable to feel that way, and I want to validate that you have a right to feel your pain is real and profound, not just a \"prize to hold on to.\" If direct crisis talk feels too difficult, please consider a therapy option like talking to a palliative care social worker, as they specialize in supporting dignity and life decisions during challenging times.",
